[32m+[m[32m# Threat Model – NovaPay Wallet Deployment (STRIDE)[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m| Threat ID | Category                  | Description                                              | Mitigation                                                                 |[m
[32m+[m[32m|-----------|---------------------------|----------------------------------------------------------|----------------------------------------------------------------------------|[m
[32m+[m[32m| T1        | Spoofing                  | Attacker impersonates a legitimate service identity      | IAM roles with least-privilege, no long-lived access keys                  |[m
[32m+[m[32m| T2        | Tampering                 | Malicious modification of wallet balances or image       | Image signing (future), Trivy gate, immutable tags, read-only FS (stretch) |[m
[32m+[m[32m| T3        | Repudiation               | Actor denies having performed an action                  | Structured JSON audit logs, CloudTrail / LocalStack equivalent             |[m
[32m+[m[32m| T4        | Information Disclosure    | Unauthorized read of wallet data or secrets              | Non-root container, Secrets Manager, no secrets in image/git, private subnet |[m
[32m+[m[32m| T5        | Denial of Service         | Overwhelm the service or datastore                       | Rate limiting (app level), DynamoDB on-demand, health/ready endpoints      |[m
[32m+[m[32m| T6        | Elevation of Privilege    | Compromised container gains host or broader AWS rights   | Non-root UID 10001, least-privilege IAM (no `*`), minimal base image       |[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Key design decisions that reduce risk[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m- Multi-stage Dockerfile → smaller attack surface[m
[32m+[m[32m- Pipeline fails hard on CRITICAL findings and on any secret[m
[32m+[m[32m- IAM policies are resource-specific; wildcards are forbidden unless justified in writing[m
[32m+[m[32m- All secrets live in Secrets Manager; rotation is documented[m
